    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d170">

                <pb facs="0279" n="197" sameAs="frus:frus1925v02/pg197"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.512362 Shipping/15</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Houghton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-12-12"><hi rendition="#italic">December 12,
                        1924</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received January 5, 1925.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 843</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the Department’s
                    instruction No. 3581, of November 8 last, in regard to taxation by Germany of
                    the earnings derived from the operation of ships documented under the laws of
                    the United States, I have the honor to report that representations were made to
                    the Foreign Office as directed therein,<anchor n="97" xml:id="d170-f1"/> and to
                    enclose herewith a copy and translation of Foreign Office <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Note Verbale</hi>, the substance of which was
                    transmitted to the Department in the Embassy’s telegram No. 256, 12 noon, of
                    December 12, 1924.<anchor n="98" xml:id="d170-f2"/></p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Ambassador:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Warren D.
                            Robbins</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Counselor of
                        Embassy</hi></closer>


                <xi:include href="d170-a1.xml" xpointer="d170-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d170-f1" n="97" xml:id="d170-f1-content">
                <p>By <hi rendition="#italic">note verbale</hi> No. 935, Nov. 29, 1924. For text of
                        <hi rendition="#italic">note verbale</hi>, see Department of State,
                    Executive Agreement Series No. 17, p. 9.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d170-f2" n="98" xml:id="d170-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram not printed.</p>
            </note>
